76,51.08],["here",51.08,51.4],["and",51.4,52.14],["I",52.14,52.46],["hope",52.46,52.64],["this",52.64,52.82],["talk",52.82,53.04],["will",53.04,53.22],["help",53.22,53.4],["you",53.4,53.56],["to",53.56,53.68],["find",53.68,53.9],["out",53.9,54.12],["more",54.12,54.44],["about",54.44,54.7],["what",54.7,54.94],["we",54.94,55.1],["do",55.1,55.38]]},{"start":55.38,"end":60.86,"text":"here and how the centre works so you can decide if this sounds the right sort of place for","words":[["here",55.38,55.76],["and",55.76,56.36],["how",56.36,56.54],["the",56.54,56.7],["centre",56.7,56.96],["works",56.96,57.44],["so",57.44,58.16],["you",58.16,58.48],["can",58.48,58.62],["decide",58.62,58.96],["if",58.96,59.18],["this",59.18,59.36],["sounds",59.36,59.68],["the",59.68,59.88],["right",59.88,60.12],["sort",60.12,60.3],["of",60.3,60.4],["place",60.4,60.64],["for",60.64,60.86]]},{"start":60.86,"end":61.62,"text":"your child.","words":[["your",60.86,61.04],["child.",61.04,61.62]]},{"start":62.78,"end":67.76,"text":"Okay, so first of all, what is the Preschool Family Centre?","words":[["Okay,",62.78,63.38],["so",63.84,64.18],["first",64.18,64.54],["of",64.54,64.72],["all,",64.72,64.94],["what",65.14,65.56],["is",65.56,65.86],["the",65.86,66.12],["Preschool",66.12,66.84],["Family",66.84,67.28],["Centre?",67.28,67.76]]},{"start":68.42,"end":74.4,"text":"Well, basically it's a childhood education centre for children from three months up","words":[["Well,",68.42,68.8],["basically",68.88,69.46],["it's",69.46,70.06],["a",70.06,70.18],["childhood",70.18,70.56],["education",70.56,71.0],["centre",71.0,71.72],["for",71.72,72.52],["children",72.52,72.88],["from",72.88,73.24],["three",73.24,73.54],["months",73.54,73.9],["up",73.9,74.4]]},{"start":74.4,"end":79.6,"text":"to five years old but we're different from a lot of other organisations for preschool","words":[["to",74.4,74.54],["five",74.54,74.86],["years",74.86,75.14],["old",75.14,75.54],["but",75.54,76.48],["we're",76.48,77.04],["different",77.04,77.32],["from",77.32,77.58],["a",77.58,77.78],["lot",77.78,77.92],["of",77.92,78.06],["other",78.06,78.24],["organisations",78.24,78.88],["for",78.88,79.24],["preschool",79.24,79.6]]},{"start":79.6,"end":85.28,"text":"children. We believe that the first educators of a child are their parents","words":[["children.",79.6,80.14],["We",80.72,81.34],["believe",81.34,81.8],["that",81.8,82.12],["the",82.12,82.26],["first",82.26,82.7],["educators",82.7,83.34],["of",83.34,83.58],["a",83.58,83.66],["child",83.66,84.14],["are",84.14,84.66],["their",84.66,84.82],["parents",84.82,85.28]]},{"start":85.28,"end":90.96,"text":"and so the pre-school family centre is organised as a cooperative by the","words":[["and",85.28,86.26],["so",86.26,86.52],["the",86.52,86.7],["pre",86.7,86.98],["-school",86.98,87.26],["family",87.26,87.72],["centre",87.72,88.2],["is",88.2,88.96],["organised",88.96,89.26],["as",89.26,89.66],["a",89.66,89.78],["cooperative",89.78,90.22],["by",90.22,90.82],["the",90.82,90.96]]},{"start":90.96,"end":96.12,"text":"parents which means it is the parents themselves who are responsible for","words":[["parents",90.96,91.34],["which",91.34,92.1],["means",92.1,92.6],["it",92.6,93.02],["is",93.02,93.16],["the",93.16,93.32],["parents",93.32,93.76],["themselves",93.76,94.4],["who",94.4,95.16],["are",95.16,95.3],["responsible",95.3,95.76],["for",95.76,96.12]]},{"start":96.12,"end":101.5,"text":"running the centre and also for running each session. So this means that we","words":[["running",96.12,96.38],["the",96.38,96.6],["centre",96.6,96.94],["and",96.94,97.48],["also",97.48,97.94],["for",97.94,98.44],["running",98.44,98.72],["each",98.72,99.0],["session.",99.0,99.42],["So",100.12,100.58],["this",100.58,100.82],["means",100.82,101.12],["that",101.12,101.34],["we",101.34,101.5]]},{"start":101.5,"end":109.58,"text":"ask parents to attend the centre with their children on a regular basis. In","words":[["ask",101.5,101.74],["parents",101.74,102.1],["to",102.1,102.34],["